@startuml
[*] --> Start : Begin Process
Start -> Login : User Registration or Login
Login -> CurrentLocationCheck : Check Weather for Current Location
CurrentLocationCheck -> NewLocationCheck : Enter Another Location
NewLocationCheck --> ValidLocation : Valid Entry
ValidLocation --> WeatherOptions : Choose Weather Data Type
WeatherOptions --> DisplayWeather : Show Selected Info
DisplayWeather --> AdditionalDetails : View More Details
AdditionalDetails --> Logout : End Session
Logout --> End
@enduml
